{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06371","headline":"不调归东川别业 · 李颀","name":"不调归东川别业","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寸禄言可取，托身将见遗。\n慙无匹夫志，悔与名山辞。\n绂冕谢知己，林园多後时。\n葛巾方濯足，蔬食但垂帷。\n十室对河岸，渔樵祗在兹。\n青郊香杜若，白水映茅茨。\n昼景彻云树，夕阴澄古逵。\n渚花独开晚，田鹤静飞迟。\n且复乐生事，前贤爲我师。\n清歌聊鼓楫，永日望佳期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06371.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06371","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}